│[39m window sales.                                                                                    [32m│
│[39m - **Eggless:** 34.7% of cake orders from July to September 2026 were eggless. In the survey, 47  [32m│
│[39m of 126 respondents asked for more eggless options.                                               [32m│
│[39m - **OMR:** Orders grew 297% over the year. 25 of 33 OMR survey respondents said the Rs. 180      [32m│
│[39m delivery charge made them give up an order, which is worth acting on.                            [32m│
│[39m - **Hamper price risk:** The survey didn't ask about hampers. Only 9 of 126 respondents would    [32m│
│[39m pay more than Rs. 1,200 for a 1 kg cake.                                                         [32m│
